                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "2ac1090c-8559-3e5f-a894-fe8e0da01cf4",
                        "entry_id": "6048435c-824c-3fa0-9145-1263dbb4ff2e",
                        "glosses": [
                            "иерархически организованная система управления обществом"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "1e1a1be3-d380-3a5c-ba89-a8617057019a",
                        "entry_id": "6048435c-824c-3fa0-9145-1263dbb4ff2e",
                        "glosses": [
                            "перен. формализм в ведении дел, пренебрежение существом дела ради соблюдения формальностей"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "bd014634-6401-4690-a80d-98319157ee52",
                        "source_entry_id": "6048435c-824c-3fa0-9145-1263dbb4ff2e",
                        "target_lang_word": "red tape",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "red tape",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "cbdc8931-e509-37fc-98ab-31849857ddab",
                                        "entry_id": "f58a9b73-e8d1-3c14-a33c-9e8e7b2ecdac",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The binding tape once used for holding important documents together."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "10d98c4a-d785-4514-99ca-6c2598c2724b",
                                                "sense_id": "cbdc8931-e509-37fc-98ab-31849857ddab",
                                                "text": "The use of red tape for tying up papers is of considerable antiquity. An advertisement in the Public Intelligencer, December 6, 1658, offers the reward for a restoration of a 'A little bundle of papers tied with a red tape, were lost on Friday last was a sevennight, between Worcester House and Lincoln's Inn."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6d265ca3-82ae-42e3-a2fe-259305052e97",
                                                "sense_id": "cbdc8931-e509-37fc-98ab-31849857ddab",
                                                "text": "At twilight in the summer there is never anybody to fear—man, woman, or cat—in the chambers and at that hour the mice come out. They do not eat parchment or foolscap or red tape, but they eat the luncheon crumbs."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5271f562-0d4a-3694-95e5-89989e30df76",
                                        "entry_id": "f58a9b73-e8d1-3c14-a33c-9e8e7b2ecdac",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Time-consuming regulations or bureaucratic procedures."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "idiomatic",
                                            "metonymically",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "33a1cecf-199b-4bd9-95f1-bca479e59c61",
                                                "sense_id": "5271f562-0d4a-3694-95e5-89989e30df76",
                                                "text": "All the red tape and paperwork that goes on there prevents any progress."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f4b1cbf4-9ccd-4ef6-be75-a44f852a3b45",
                                                "sense_id": "5271f562-0d4a-3694-95e5-89989e30df76",
                                                "text": "That committee does not cut through red tape ; it merely provides better scheduling for different agencies so you do not have sequential review by different agencies , so that you have some kind of simultaneity in the review by different agencies."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3c31ea63-1717-4a11-b73d-28794aa59965",
                                                "sense_id": "5271f562-0d4a-3694-95e5-89989e30df76",
                                                "text": "One conspicuous cost of the compromise reached was a promise made by Senator Chuck Schumer to Manchin on what was vaguely called permitting reform: a catchall phrase referring to a whole host of efforts to cut red tape and ease the rollout of energy infrastructure."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "37d4f640-4e08-4f8e-b04a-ea8857af8b15",
                                                "sense_id": "5271f562-0d4a-3694-95e5-89989e30df76",
                                                "text": "They said we’d be free of all that tedious European red tape and would take back control of our borders, encouraging anyone agitated by immigration to believe that fewer people would come in. […] Post-Brexit red tape is strangling thousands of small businesses, whether travelling musicians or exporters of goods, tying them up in daunting forms or extra charges that cost time and money they don’t have."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "71aa9b23-ed82-48ab-a0d6-0e3266fafaa3",
                        "source_entry_id": "6048435c-824c-3fa0-9145-1263dbb4ff2e",
                        "target_lang_word": "Bürokratismus",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Bürokratismus",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "006f0702-3393-31fb-8051-05b4631f6de0",
                                        "entry_id": "d686da73-d525-30ad-a930-9e6d8c1d75d8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "stark überzogene Form von Bürokratie, die mit Entmenschlichung einhergeht"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "12ecbdfa-d09c-4c5b-ac61-3aab291e9424",
                                                "sense_id": "006f0702-3393-31fb-8051-05b4631f6de0",
                                                "text": "„Während die totalitäre Propaganda von Kriegsrhetorik lebte und die Neuformierung der Gesellschaft durch den Ausnahmezustand in Permanenz anstrebte, zielte Verwoerd auf die Errichtung eines kalten Bürokratismus ab.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
